<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EPH" style="id">- Mbunga Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Waefesu</para>
  <para style="toc3">Waef</para>
  <para style="toc2">Waefesu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Lihamba lya Paulo kwa Waefesu</para>
  <para style="mt2">Lihamba lya Paulo kwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Waefesu</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongolelu wa Waefesu</para>
  <para style="ip">Lihamba kwa Waefesu liyandikilwi lipindi lilalila paliyandikwa lihamba lya kolosai kumachuva gha isitini badili gha kuweleka Kilisito. Mndumindumi Paulo anguilongela yiwa myandika wa kihitabu haki ni mweni 1:1. Wasomi watangala wangujumila yiwa Paulo ndiwa kayandika pamonga na yiwa liwela ng'ogha na hila ndambu ghaki gha kujambusa hila iwoneka kukihitabu kya Kolosai. Kwaikiva gha nagha ikalasimika kutindila mapinga gha wandu wamkwinila kilisito watangala wa haku mmbwani. Paulo hila hila kalongela yiwa awelili mkihungo lipindi anguyandika lihamba hali. kusula gha 3:1, 4:1, na 6:20. Paulo akamtumila Tikiku kumwanja ghaki awayegheli lihamba wandu wa mapinga yeni kumkwinila Kilisito haku Efesu. Kusula gha 6:21-22</para>
  <para style="ip">Efesu uwelili mmbwani mkulu nesu na mmbwani wenikuwela na selikali gha Waloma kumlima wa Asia mnung'una. Mmbwani wa Efesu uwelile ungumanyikana nesu kwa kuwela na lighuta lya mulungu mdala wa Kigiliki mwenikukemwa Atemi kusula gha Matendu 19:23-31. Lipinga lya wandu wamkwinila Kilisito lya haku Efesu liwelili na makakala palitumbula na kumwihu likapola Ugubutulo kusula gha 2:1-7.</para>
  <para style="ip">Paulo angulongela nusu ghaki gha mtumbulo gha lihamba lyaki hali vila Sapanga kawahaghula wandu ghaki na kuwalokola kuhuma kusambi syao kwa kumkwinila Yesu Kilisito. Angulandanisa wandu ghaki wamkwinila handa mhiga na Kilisito ndiwa mutu hilahila mweni ndiwa kitamilo kya lighuta. Kumbandi ghangi kulihamba hali Paulo angulongela vila wandu wakilisito wangupalwa kulama.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gha Mghati:</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo angulongela yiwa mweni kaghani na kuwajambusa wandu wa haku Efesu 1:1-2</para>
  <para style="io">Kangi angulongela mkonganiko wa wakwinila na Kilisito 1:3-3:21</para>
  <para style="io">Kangi Paulo angulongela vila Wakilisito wangupalwa kulama 4:1-6:20</para>
  <para style="io">Mwihu Paulo anguyomola kwa kuwapegha usauli wekaweka wandu wa Efesu. 6:21-24</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EPH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 1:1" />Nenga Paulo, mndumindumi wa kilisito Yesu, handa vila apalili mweni Sapanga,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EPH 1:1">ninguwayandikila hali lihamba mwenga wenikujumilwa na Sapanga kwa kukongana na Kilisito Yesu haku Efesu.<verse eid="EPH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 1:2" />Ninguwayupila kwa Sapanga Tati wa twenga na Yesu Kilisito Bambu wa twenga awapeghi umaha na mlikali kwa kuponga.<verse eid="EPH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhighilwa patukongana na Kilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 1:3" />Asifilwi Sapanga na Tati wa Bambu wa twenga Yesu Kilisito! Mweni ndiwa katupegha highili zya kumpumulo zyeni kuhuma kundumba kwa kukonganika na hayu Kilisito. <verse eid="EPH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 1:4" />Hinu pambila gha kulumbwa mlima wogha, Sapanga atuhaghulile tuweli wandu ghaki kukukongana na Kilisito ili tuweli wandu ghaki,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EPH 1:4">kwaikiva gha upalo ghaki. <verse eid="EPH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 1:5" />Sapanga avikili lukani kuhuma dahile kutuhaghula tuweli wana ghaki kwa njila gha Yesu Kilisito. Agholile nagha kukovekelana na kutupala twenga. <verse eid="EPH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 1:6" />Kwa nagha tungumshukwile Sapanga kwa umaha ghaki wa kukangasa, hula katupegha bila mahipo kwa njila gha umaha wa Mwana ghaki mpalwa. <verse eid="EPH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 1:7" />Kwa kuhova kwaki hayu Mwana, twenga tukapokela ukombola ingumaanisa tulekeselwa sambi handa vila uwela utangala umaha ghaki. <verse eid="EPH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 1:8" />Sapanga kaghola nagha ili kutulangiha yiwa</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EPH 1:8">kana luhala vilavila angumanya yala tunguyapala, <verse eid="EPH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 1:9" />Sapanga agholile mighalu ghaki aihighili, mghalu hula avikili lukani yiwa ateughola kupitila Kilisito. <verse eid="EPH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 1:10" />Hagha yategholeka lipindi lila alivikili Sapanga palihika, ni kukungula hindu hyogha gha kundumba na kumlimawogha.<verse eid="EPH 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 1:11" />Vindu vyogha vingugholeka kukovekalana na vila Sapanga kaghola na kulamula, na Sapanga katuhaghula tuweli wandu ghaki kukukongana na Kilisito handa aipalile na alamulile nagha kuhuma dahile. <verse eid="EPH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 1:12" />Hinu, twenga weni kulongola kumtumainila Kilisito, tungupalwa tumsifili Sapanga kwaikiva gha ukulu ghaki.<verse eid="EPH 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 1:13" />Mwenga hilahila kupitila hayu, mhyughanila kala lilando lya uchakaka, Habali Maha yeni kuwayeghela ulokola, na mkamkwinila Kilisito. Na mweni Sapanga ili kulangiha yiwa mwenga ni wandu ghaki akavika kilangihi, kwa kuwapegha Mpumulo ghaki handa awalongilile yiwa atewapegha. <verse eid="EPH 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 1:14" />Hayu Mpumulo kawela handa poni kulangiha yiwa Sapanga atewapegha wandu ghaki kila alongilile na mghalu hau ungutuhighilisila yiwa Sapanga atewakombola wandu ghaki. Tumsifili Sapanga kwa ukulu ghaki.<verse eid="EPH 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo anguwayupila Waefesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 1:15" />Hinu kuhuma nihyoghanila vila mungumkwinila Bambu Yesu, na mapalo gha mwenga kwa wandu wogha wa Sapanga, <verse eid="EPH 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 1:16" />ningumshukwile Sapanga kwaikiva gha mwenga. Kila paninguyupa ninguwaisemwa ng'ogha, <verse eid="EPH 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 1:17" />ili Sapanga wa Bambu wa twenga Yesu Kilisito, Tati awelili mkulu, awapeghi mwenga Mpumulo wa luhala na gha ugubutulo kukummanya mweni. <verse eid="EPH 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 1:18" />Kangi ningumluwa Sapanga agubutuli mioyu gha mwenga, ili mpati kumanya lila litumaini mkemilwa na unaisa mkulu wa hupo awavikilile wandu ghaki, <verse eid="EPH 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 1:19" />mpati kumanya vila uwesu ghaki uwela mkulu nesu kwa twenga weni kumkwinila. Uweso hau weni kughola mahengu mghati gha twenga nimakulu nesu, <verse eid="EPH 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 1:20" />makakala ghala yawoneka pala Sapanga paamuhindulile Kilisito, akamtamisa mbandi ghaki gha kuliyila kundumba. <verse eid="EPH 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 1:21" />Haku, Kilisito angulongosa kila nkosi na vilongosi waghangi. Angulongosa kila kindu kyeni kulongosa, ni mkulu kupiti makakala yeyosi wanguyatundamila wandu. Angulongosa vilongosi wa mlima wogha hau wa hinaa na wandu wala wa mlima wogha hula utehika. <verse eid="EPH 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 1:22" />Sapanga kaghola vindu vyogha vilongoswi na mweni, na kamghola mweni aweli mutu wa lipinga lyeni kumkwinila Kilisito, <verse eid="EPH 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 1:23" />lipinga lya weni kumkwinila Kilisito ni mhigha wa Kilisito na kangi lipinga lya weni kumkwinila ni utimila ghaki Kilisito, mweni ni handa mutu wa hali lipinga kangi ndiwa mweni kughola mighalu hyogha.<verse eid="EPH 1:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EPH 2" />
  <para style="s">Kuhuma kukihu mbaka kuukomu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 2:1" />Mwenga muwelili handa muhova kwaikiva gha mahakata na sambi msighola. <verse eid="EPH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 2:2" />Lipindi lila muwelili mngukovekela mighalu mihakata gha mlima wogha hau, muwelili mungumuyitikila Lihyukana, yula mwenikuwela mkulu wa kunani yula mwenikughola lihengu na wala weni kumyitikila ng'ogha Sapanga. <verse eid="EPH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 2:3" />Haku dahile twenga wogha tumyitikila ng'ogha Sapanga handa weni vila wangughola. Tulamili kwa lumatamata vila mihigha na malangu ingupala kughola, hinu twenga handa weni tupalilwi kunyokolwa na Sapanga.<verse eid="EPH 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 2:4" />Ila Sapanga kana luhungu nesu, na angutupala nesu, <verse eid="EPH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 2:5" />hata pala patuwela handa tuhova kwaikiva gha sambi tusighola, akatughola tuweli wakomu pamonga na Kilisito, kwa umaha wa Sapanga twenga tulokolwa. <verse eid="EPH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 2:6" />Hinu kwa kukonganiswa na Kilisito Yesu, Sapanga atuhindulili pamonga na mweni, tukalongosi pamonga na mweni kundumba. <verse eid="EPH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 2:7" />Ndiwa aipalili kulangiha kwa wandu wa lipindi lya kuulongolo ukulu wa umaha ghaki, atupeghili kwa upalo kumkonganiko wa twenga na Kilisito Yesu. <verse eid="EPH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 2:8" />Hinu kwaikiva mlokolwa kwa umaha wa Sapanga, kwa njila gha kukwinila, ng'ogha kwa matendu maheli mghola. Ulokola hau ni hupo kuhuma kwa Sapanga. <verse eid="EPH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 2:9" />Kawalokola ng'ogha kukovekelana na matendu maheli mghola, hinu mundu yoyosi akotoho kulitutumula. <verse eid="EPH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 2:10" />Twenga twa viumbi ghaki Sapanga, na kwa kukongine na Kilisito Yesu, katulumba ili tulami kundyangilu gha matendu maheli atuyandalilile tulami.<verse eid="EPH 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Umonga patuwela na Kilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 2:11" />Mwenga muwelekwa ng'ogha mkiwela Wayahudi. Mwenga mngukemwa, “Wandu muyingiswa ng'ogha jandu,” na Wayahudi weni wangulikema, “Wenikuyingiswa jandu,” kuyingiswa jandu kwa weni ni kula kweni kungugholwa kwa mawoko gha wandu. <verse eid="EPH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 2:12" />Hinu lipindi lya dahile mwenga muwelili mummanya ng'ogha Kilisito, muwelili mbaghulwa na wandu wa Izilaeli, muwelili wahenja na muwela ng'ogha malaghano alongilile Sapanga kwa wandu ghaki. Muwelili ng'ogha na litumaini na mummanyile ng'ogha Sapanga. <verse eid="EPH 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 2:13" />Ila hinaa, kwa kukonganiswa na Kilisito Yesu, mwenga weni kuwela kutali haku mtumbulo muwela pabehi kwa kupitila kihu kyaki Yesu Kilisito kulipingika, <verse eid="EPH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 2:14" />kwaikiva mweni ndiwa kulikala kwa kuponga kwa twenga kwa kuwaghola Wayahudi na wandu wawela ng'ogha Wayahudi kuwela wamonga. Kwamhigha ghaki mweni abongonyokili lila likuta liwalekesenili na kuwaghola wahyomilani. <verse eid="EPH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 2:15" />Kilisito paahovili kulipingika kahumisa makakala gha malaghilo apeghilwi Musa, ili kupitila hagha mapinga maivili waweli kindu kimonga kihyonu kwa kukonganika na mweni Yesu, hinu katuyeghela kulikala kwa kuponga na mweni . <verse eid="EPH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 2:16" />Kwa njila gha kuhova ahumisili ngondo gha Wayahudi na wala wawela Wayahudi ng'ogha na kuwavika kulipingika limonga. Kangi kawakonganisa kwa Sapanga. <verse eid="EPH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 2:17" />Hinu Kilisito, ahikile na kutangasa Habali Maha gha kuponga kwa mwenga wandu muwela ng'ogha Wayahudi, wenikuwela kutali na Sapanga na hilahila kwa Wayahudi wenikuwela pabehi na Sapanga. <verse eid="EPH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 2:18" />Hinu kwa kupitila Kilisito, twenga wogha Wayahudi na wandu Wayahudi ng'ogha, tunguwesa kumyendelela Tati kwa kupitila Mpumulo mmonga hayuhayu.<verse eid="EPH 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 2:19" />Hinu, mwenga mwa ng'ogha wahenja kangi, wala wandu wa panji ila muwela wenikaya pamonga na wandu wa Sapanga. Mwenga ni weni kaya ukaya kwa Sapanga. <verse eid="EPH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 2:20" />Mwenga mchengwa kumavulo gha wandumindumi na walota, handa lighuta lyeni kuchengwa kunani gha kitamilo, na Yesu Kilisito akiwela handa mghomba wa hali lighuta. <verse eid="EPH 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 2:21" />Hayu Kilisito ndiwa mweni kulikonganisa lighuta lyogha na kulighola likuli hata likawela lighuta lya Sapanga. <verse eid="EPH 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 2:22" />Kukukongana na Kilisito mwenga mnguchengwa pamonga na waghangi muweli ili Sapanga alami mghati gha mwenga, kupitila Mpumulo ghaki.<verse eid="EPH 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EPH 3" />
  <para style="s">Lihengu lya Paulo kwa wenikuwela ng'ogha Wayahudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 3:1" />Kwaikiva gha hagha nenga Paulo mweni kuwopwa kwaikiva gha Kilisito Yesu ninguwayupila mwenga weni kuwela ng'ogha Wayahudi. <verse eid="EPH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 3:2" />Hinu myughanila kala yiwa Sapanga kwa umaha ghaki, anipeghili lihengu hali kwa fwaida gha mwenga. <verse eid="EPH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 3:3" />Ila Sapanga kanigubutulila nimanyi kifisu haki na nenga niwayandikila kwa kihupi habali hai, <verse eid="EPH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 3:4" />mwenga pamusoma kwa umaheli, mtewesa kumanya vila nenga ninguumanya mghalu wa kifisu haki kya Kilisito. <verse eid="EPH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 3:5" />Kifisu haki Sapanga haku dahile awahighilisili ng'ogha wandu wa viwelekwa vighangi, handa awagubutulile wandumindumi na walota ghaki awahaghulile hinaa kwa kupitila Mpumulo ghaki. <verse eid="EPH 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 3:6" />Kifisu kyeni ni haki, kwa kupitila Habali Maha wandu wawela ng'ogha Wayahudi wangupokela lilundila lyau pamonga na Wayahudi. Weni wangukongana kulilaghano lilalila aligholile Sapanga kupitila Kilisito Yesu.<verse eid="EPH 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 3:7" />Nenga nigholwa kuwela mtumikila wa Habali Maha kwa umaha ghaki Sapanga anipeghili na kwa uwesa ghaki mkulu. <verse eid="EPH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 3:8" />Nenga ni mnung'una kupiti wandu wogha wa Sapanga, ila kanipegha umaha ghaki, ili niwatangasili wandu wawela ng'ogha Wayahudi, highili zyaki Kilisito ziwela zitangala, <verse eid="EPH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 3:9" />kangi Sapanga anipeghili mahengu gha kuwalongela wandu kunani gha mghalu wa kifisu kyaki kya chakaka. Afisili kifisu haki kya uchakaka mghati ghaki kuhuma mtumbulo wa lipindi, ndiwa mweni kulumba kila kindu. <verse eid="EPH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 3:10" />Hinu hinaa Sapanga angupala wandu wogha weni kumkwinila Kilisito wamlangihi kila mundu vila mweni kawela na luhala lyogha, angupala vilongosi weni kuwela kumlimawogha weni kuwoneka ng'ogha wamanyi vindu havi. <verse eid="EPH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 3:11" />Hali liwelili lukani lya Sapanga kuhuma dahile na Bambu wa twenga Yesu Kilisito ndiwa mweni kughola hagha. <verse eid="EPH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 3:12" />Hinu kwa kukonganiswa na Kilisito na kwa kumkwinila mweni, twenga tungumyendela Sapanga bila holu. <verse eid="EPH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 3:13" />Ninguwaluwa mkotoho kutwenyuka moyu kwa mahakilo hagha yeni kunikola kwaikiva gha mwenga, yeni yangunikola ili mwenga mpati utundamilu.<verse eid="EPH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Upalu wa Kilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 3:14" />Kukovekelana na mghalu hau wa Tati ningutova manung'una ili niwayupili mwenga, <verse eid="EPH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 3:15" />mweni ndiwa mweni kulumba kila kindu kumlimawogha na kundumba. <verse eid="EPH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 3:16" />Hinu ningumyupa Sapanga awagangamalisi kwa kuwavika makakala mioyu gha mwenga kwa njila gha Mpumulo ghaki kukovekelana na utangala wa ukulu ghaki. <verse eid="EPH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 3:17" />Ili Kilisito alikali kumioyu gha mwenga kwa njila gha kumkwinila mweni, kangi ningumluwa awatangi kugangamala nesu kuupalo ghaki, hinu upalo ghaki utewela handa mikegha kungalilu gha mwenga. <verse eid="EPH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 3:18" />Sapanga awapeghi mwenga na wandu wogha wahaghulilwi na mweni, uweso wa kumanya vila Kilisito katupala. Upalo ghaki kwa twenga ni mkulu nesu, na weni kuwela ng'ogha na mwihu, <verse eid="EPH 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 3:19" />Ninguluwa mpati kumanya upalo hau, pamonga na yiwa iwesekana ng'ogha kumanya vila uwela mkulu, kwa nagha ndiwa ndyangilu gha mwenga itelandana na Sapanga.<verse eid="EPH 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 3:20" />Sapanga anguwesa kughola mighalu mikulunga kupiti vila tunguluwa na kuliwachila, kupitila makakala ghaki yeni kughola mahengu mghati gha twenga. <verse eid="EPH 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 3:21" />Tungupala wandu wogha wa Sapanga wamanyi yiwa Sapanga kamkulu, na kila mweni kumkwinila Kilisito amuyinuli mweni machuwa hyogha bila mwihu! Hina.<verse eid="EPH 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EPH 4" />
  <para style="s">Kukongana kwa wandu wangumkwinila Kilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 4:1" />Hinu, nenga niwela muuwopwa kwaikiva ningumtumikila Bambu, ninguwalongela mlami vila ingupalwa mlami kukovekelana na Sapanga kawakema. <verse eid="EPH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 4:2" />Walongu ghangu, mnyenyekelane na kuwela wanyalinyali na wafumilifu lipindi lyogha, kunu mkilekeselana kwa upalu, <verse eid="EPH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 4:3" />myangali kugholokela umonga weni kuyeghwa na Mpumulo wa Sapanga kwa kulama pamonga kwa kuponga. <verse eid="EPH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 4:4" />Twenga wogha tuwela handa mhigha mmonga, kangi tuwela na Mpumulo wa Sapanga mmonga. Hinu, Sapanga atukemili na kutuvikila litumaini limonga lya kukemwa kwa twenga. <verse eid="EPH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 4:5" />Kangi kuwela na Bambu mmonga, na kukwinila kumonga, na ubatisu mmonga, <verse eid="EPH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 4:6" />Sapanga mmonga na mwenikuwela Tati wa wogha na mweni kulongosa hindu hyogha na angughola lihengu kupitila wandu wogha na kamghati mwa wandu wogha.<verse eid="EPH 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 4:7" />Kila mundu paghati gha twenga apeghilwi hupo gha kimpumulo kwa vila apalili mweni Kilisito. <verse eid="EPH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 4:8" />Handa vila Mayandiko gha Sapanga yayandikilwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 4:8">“Paayendili kunani nesu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 4:8">akatola watumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga, akatola wawopwa wa mngondu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 4:8">na akawapegha wandu hupo.” <verse eid="EPH 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 4:9" />Hinu, pailongwa, “Ayendili kunani nesu,” ingumanisa niki? Ingumaanisa nagha, ahulukili pahi nesu kumlimawogha. <verse eid="EPH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 4:10" />Hinu, ikiwela hayu hayu ahulukili pahi nesu, ndiwa hayu hayu ayendili kundumba ili aweli kila mahala kumlimawogha. <verse eid="EPH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 4:11" />Mweni ndiwa awapeghili wandu hupo wekaweka, waghangi, awagholile waweli wankosi, na ghangi waweli walota, na waghangi wawelili watangasa lilando lya Sapanga, na waghangi waweli wahungaji na wavula. <verse eid="EPH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 4:12" />Hinu, agholili nagha lukani wawatangi wandu wa Sapanga kughola lihengu lyaki, ili wandu weni kumkwinila Kilisito waweli wagangamala handa mhigha wa Kilisito, ingumanisa lipinga lya wandu weni kumkwinila Kilisito. <verse eid="EPH 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 4:13" />Mghalu hau uteyendelela mbaka twenga wogha tutewela kuukwinila mmonga na kukummanya mwana wa Sapanga. Tutewela wandu tukamala na tutetimila handa Kilisito vila mweni kawela. <verse eid="EPH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 4:14" />Ndiwa tutewela ng'ogha handa wana wanung'una, wenikuwesa kutolwa haku na haku na kukweghwa na kila liyegha lya mavulo gha wandu weni kukalamuka weni kuwabyodosa waghangi. <verse eid="EPH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 4:15" />Hinu patulongelana uchakaka kwa upalu, tutewela ng'ogha wanung'una kangi ila tutekamala kwa kila mghalu tukilandana na Kilisito mweni kuwela kilongosi. <verse eid="EPH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 4:16" />Kuulongosi ghaki, vikongonu vyogha vya higha vingukolana pamonga, na higha hyogha ingukamala kwa kutangana vikongonu vyogha. Hinu, kila kikongonu pakiteghola lihengu vila ingupalwa, mhigha wogha ukula na kuichenga ku upalo.<verse eid="EPH 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngalilu hyonu gha kumkwinila Kilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 4:17" />Hinu, ninguwalongela nagha, na kuwakanisa nikiwela na Bambu, yiwa mkotoho kulikala kangi handa wandu wamkwinila ng'ogha Sapanga, weni kuwela mawachilo ghao yamema usihisihi, <verse eid="EPH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 4:18" />na malangu ghao yawela mulwisa. Wawela kutali na ukomu wa Sapanga kwaikiva gha undyungi uwela mghati gha weni na kinyengu wawela nachu, <verse eid="EPH 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 4:19" />Wandu hagha wawela ng'ogha na honi, lipindi wangughola mahakata na wanguyendelela kughola mighalu mihakata kwaikiva gha kuihekelesa weni.<verse eid="EPH 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 4:20" />Lipindi mngulivula habali zya Kilisito mlivula ng'ogha mighalu mihakata. <verse eid="EPH 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 4:21" />Handa ndiwa iwela, mwenga mumhyoghanila kangi mvulwa na mweni, vila chakaka iwela ku Kilisito Yesu. <verse eid="EPH 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 4:22" />Hinu mwenga mngupalwa kulikala kutali na hila ndyangilu muwelile nayu haku dahile yeni kuwayalamisa na lumatamata lweni kungonga, <verse eid="EPH 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 4:23" />ili mgholwi wahyonu kumioyu na kumawachilo, <verse eid="EPH 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 4:24" />Kila mmonga wa mwenga aweli na ngalilu hyonu handa vila Sapanga kawalumba mlandani na mweni, mkighola mighalu yeni kumhekelesa Sapanga bila mahakata.<verse eid="EPH 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 4:25" />Hinu, walongu wa nenga muleki kulongela uhwangi, kila mundu kangupalwa kumlongela muyaki uchakaka, kwaikiva kila mmonga wa twenga ni vikongonu vya mhigha mmonga. <verse eid="EPH 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 4:26" />Hinu pamhyoma, mkotoho kuleka lilaka lya mwenga liwagholi mgholi sambi, na mleki kulikala na lilaka lichuwa lyogha, <verse eid="EPH 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 4:27" />wala kumpegha Lihyukana fwasi gha kuwasinda. <verse eid="EPH 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 4:28" />Na mundu yula awelili mwihi, aleki kuhuyila kangi wihi, ila agholi lihengu lyaki kwa kuyangala, na aweli na kindu kya kuwapegha wandu kapuku. <verse eid="EPH 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 4:29" />Mkotoho kulongela milando mihakata, lipindi lyogha mlongeli milando gha maheli yeni kuwachenga waghangi ili yawatangi wala wenikuyoghanila. <verse eid="EPH 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 4:30" />Mkotoho kumnyengemalisa Mpumulo wa Sapanga, kwaikiva Mpumulo hayu ni kilangihi kya Sapanga kwa mwenga kyeni kulangiha yiwa mwenga ni wandu ghaki, mbaka lichuwa lila Sapanga atewalokola. <verse eid="EPH 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 4:31" />Hinu, mleki magombi na kuhyoma na lilaka na kukalipa na malighu mleki kughola uhakata wowosi weni kuwesa kuwahakila waghangi. <verse eid="EPH 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 4:32" />Hinu muweli na luhungu na muweli na moyu wa kulitanga, na kila mmonga na amlekeseli mahakata myaki handa vila Sapanga amlekesenili mwenga sambi kupitila Kilisito.<verse eid="EPH 4:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EPH 5" />
  <para style="s">Kulama kumhana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 5:1" />Hinu walongu ghangu, mlami kwa kukovekela mlandano ghaki Sapanga kwaikiva mwenga ni wana ghaki wapalwa. <verse eid="EPH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 5:2" />Upalo ulongosi ngalilu gha mwenga handa vila Kilisito atupalile twenga, kwa kulighola mweni aweli litambiko lya kulungusa lyeni manungilo maheli na lyeni kumhekelesa Sapanga.<verse eid="EPH 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 5:3" />Mwenga ni wandu wa Sapanga, hinu ngongola, ndaka yeyosi au uwimi vikotoho kulongelwa katu kwa mwenga, <verse eid="EPH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 5:4" />kangi mkotoho kulongela milando gha honi, usihisihi au kubisana, hagha hyogha ghamaha ng'ogha kwa mwenga, milando gha kumshukwile Sapanga ndiwa maheli kwa mwenga. <verse eid="EPH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 5:5" />Mmanyi yiwa mundu yeyosi mwenikuwela mghola ndaka au mhakata au mwimi, kwaikiva hai ni ndambu ghangi gha kuyupa ling'omung'omu. Mundu yeyosi wa ndambu hai atepata ng'ogha chochosi kuunkosi wa Kilisito na wa Sapanga.<verse eid="EPH 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 5:6" />Mkotoho kungongwa na milando gha kubyodosa, kwaikiva Sapanga atewanyokola wandu wogha weni kumyitikila ng'ogha. <verse eid="EPH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 5:7" />Hinu walongu ghangu mkotoho kulikongana na weni. <verse eid="EPH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 5:8" />Haku dahile mwenga muwelili mlwisa, ila hinaa mwenga muwela kumhana kwa kukonga na Bambu. Hinu mlikali handa wana wa kumhana. <verse eid="EPH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 5:9" />Wandu weni kulama kumhana wangughola mighalu gha maheli na gha maha na gha chakaka lipindi lyogha. <verse eid="EPH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 5:10" />Mwenga myangali kumanya ghala yeni kumhekelesa Bambu. <verse eid="EPH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 5:11" />Mkotoho kughola mighalu gha maha ng'ogha, ila muwalongeli wandu yiwa mighalu hai ghamaha ng'ogha. <verse eid="EPH 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 5:12" />Mighalu yenikugholwa kukifisu na wandu wahakata ni honi hata kuilongela. <verse eid="EPH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 5:13" />Ila mhana ungulangiha lipali yiwa mighalu hai, yiwa ghamaha ng'ogha. <verse eid="EPH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 5:14" />kwaikiva kila kindu kinguvikwa paluagha na mhana. Ndiwa kwaikiva tungulongela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 5:14">“Uyimuki wenga mweni kuwonja!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 5:14">Uhinduki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 5:14">na mhana wa Kilisito utewela kwa wenga.”<verse eid="EPH 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 5:15" />Hinu, mtami mihu vila mngulama. Mkotoho kulama handa wandyungi, ila handa wandu weni luhala. <verse eid="EPH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 5:16" />Mtumili maheli lipindi hali muwela nalu kwaikiva machuwa hagha ni machuwa gha uhakata, <verse eid="EPH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 5:17" />kangi mkotoho kuwela wandyungi, ila myesi kumanya ghala yangupalwa na Sapanga.<verse eid="EPH 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 5:18" />Mleki kulowela uyimbi kwaikiva hai itewayalamisa, ila mmemeswi Mpumulo wa Sapanga. <verse eid="EPH 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 5:19" />Myimbilane mwenga kwa mwenga, mkiyimbilana uyimbu gha kumpumulo, mkimyimbila na kumsifila Bambu kumioyu gha mwenga. <verse eid="EPH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 5:20" />Mumshukwile Sapanga Tati machuwa hyogha kwa ghala hyogha agholile, kwa lihina lya Bambu Yesu Kilisito.<verse eid="EPH 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wangwana na wahumbu weni kukwinila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 5:21" />Kila mundu amyitikili myaki kwaikiva gha kumtundamila Kilisito.<verse eid="EPH 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 5:22" />Mwenga wahumbu, muwayitikili wangwana wa mwenga handa vila mungumyitikila Bambu wa mwenga Yesu Kilisito, <verse eid="EPH 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 5:23" />kwaikiva mngwana ni kilongosi wa mhumbu ghaki, handa Kilisito vila kawela kilongosi wa lipinga lyeni kumkwinila. Kangi Kilisito ni mlokola wa lipinga lya weni kumkwinila, hinu ni handa mhigha ghaki. <verse eid="EPH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 5:24" />Hinu handa vila wakwinila wangumyitikila Kilisito, hilahila na wahumbu wawayitikili wangwana ghao kukila mghalu.<verse eid="EPH 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 5:25" />Mwenga wangwana, muwapali wahumbu wa mwenga handa vila agholili Kilisito paalipalili lipinga lyeni kumkwinila, akajihumisa ahweghi kwaikiva gha lipinga hali. <verse eid="EPH 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 5:26" />Agholile nagha ili kwa lilando lyaki atughululi na kuwela wandu wa Sapanga, na agholile na badili gha kutuwofula kwa masi, <verse eid="EPH 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 5:27" />apalile kulipatila lipinga lyeni kujumilwa kuulongolo gha Sapanga na lyeni kuwela ng'ogha na uhakata, ndaka au chochosi kyeni kulandana na mahakata. <verse eid="EPH 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 5:28" />Hilahila wangwana wangupalwa wawapali wahumbu ghao handa mihigha ghao weni, kwaikiva mngwana mweni kumpala mhumbu ghaki angulipala mweni, <verse eid="EPH 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 5:29" />kwahela mundu mweni kulema mhigha ghaki, ila kuupegha mulyo na kuuvwalisa. Ndiwa handa Kilisito angulilela lipinga. <verse eid="EPH 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 5:30" />Kwaikiva twenga ni vikongonu vya mhigha ghaki. <verse eid="EPH 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 5:31" />Hinu handa yala mayandiko yangulongela, “Kwaikiva gha nagha, mlumi atemleka tati ghaki na nyongo ghaki, atekonganika na mhumbu ghaki na hagha waivili watewela mhigha mmonga.” <verse eid="EPH 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 5:32" />Kuwela na uchakaka weni kulihigha kumilando hai, ila nenga ningulola yiwa hagha yangumlongelela Kilisito na lipinga lyaki lyeni kumkwinila. <verse eid="EPH 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EPH 5:33" />Ila kila mmonga wa mwenga angupalwa kumpala mhumbu handa vila anguipala mweni. Na mhumbu angupalwa kumyitikila mngwana ghaki.<verse eid="EPH 5:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EPH 6" />
  <para style="s">Walela na wana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 6:1" />Hinu mwenga wana, muwayitikili walela wa mwenga kwaikiva mngumkwinila Bambu, na hau ni mghalu wa maha. <verse eid="EPH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 6:2" />Laghilo lya Sapanga lingulonga, “Watundamili tati ghako na nyongo ghako.” Hali ndiwa laghilo lya mtumbula lyeni lilaghanu, <verse eid="EPH 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 6:3" />“Ili uighilwi na kulama machuwa matangala kumlimawogha.”<verse eid="EPH 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 6:4" />Mwenga akina tati, mkotoho kuwahyomelesa wana wa mwenga, ila muwaleli kumavulo na makaniso ghaki Bambu Yesu.<verse eid="EPH 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wahusutu na wabambu ghao</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 6:5" />Mwenga wahusutu, muwayitikili wabambu wa mwenga haku kumlimawogha kwa holu na utundamilu, na mgholi nagha kwa moyu wogha handa mngumtumikila Kilisito, <verse eid="EPH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 6:6" />mgholi nagha, ng'ogha kwa lipindi lila wanguwalola ili wapati kuwasifila, bali mtumikili kwa moyu mkighola ghala anguyapala Sapanga. <verse eid="EPH 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 6:7" />Mgholi mahengu kwa moyu wogha, handa mngumgholela Bambu na ng'ogha wandu, <verse eid="EPH 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 6:8" />mkikubwiki yiwa Bambu atemhipa kila mundu kukovekelana na matendu ghaki maheli, aweli mpekesu au muhusutu.<verse eid="EPH 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 6:9" />Mwenga mabambu, muwagholeli mighalu maheli wahusutu wa mwenga, na mleki kutumila vitisu, kunu mkimanya yiwa mwenga na wahusutu wa mwenga muwela na Bambu mmonga mwenikulikala kundumba, na mweni kahela ubaghula.<verse eid="EPH 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sapanga angututanga kuwela tugangamali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 6:10" />Kumwihu, ningupala kulonga nagha, mlikongani na Bambu, na makakala ghaki yatewatanga. <verse eid="EPH 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 6:11" />Mvwali hindu hyogha gha kutovanila mpeghwa na Sapanga, ili muwesi kusinda ukalamuki wa Lihyukana, <verse eid="EPH 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 6:12" />mgholi nagha kwaikiva tungutovana ng'ogha na wandu, bali tungulitova na vilongosi wa mahoka na mahoka yeni makakala yeni kulongosa kunani gha umlimawogha hau wenikuwela mlwisa. Na tungutovana na mahoka yenikuwela mahala wekaweka kunani. <verse eid="EPH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 6:13" />Hinu walongu ghangu mvwali hindu hyogha gha kutovanila mpeghwa na Sapanga, ili lichuwa lihakata palihika, muwesi kusinda na pamyomola ngondu muyendeleli kugholoka kwa ugangamalu.<verse eid="EPH 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 6:14" />Hinu mliyandali, uchakaka ukaweli handa mhungi mkibulibulilo, na kughola yeni kujumilwa na Sapanga kukaweli handa nguu gha lyuma kulikinga mkitivi, <verse eid="EPH 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 6:15" />na luhujulu lwa kutangasa Habali Maha gha kulama kwa kuponga kuweli handa hilatu mmaghulu gha mwenga. <verse eid="EPH 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 6:16" />Na kukwinila kwa mwenga machuwa hyogha kuweli handa vila mngukola mapangalala, ili mpati kungingama migoha gha lyoto gha yula mhakata. <verse eid="EPH 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 6:17" />Mupokeli ulokola handa likokoma lya lyuma lyeni kuwagholokela, na Lilando lya Sapanga handa lipanga mpeghwa na Mpumulo wa Sapanga, <verse eid="EPH 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 6:18" />Muweli mkiyupa lipindi lyogha kwa mayupo yoyosi handa Mpumulo wa Sapanga vila anguwalongosa, mlikali mihu kwa mghalu hau lipindi lyogha na motoho kutoka kuwayupila waandu wa Sapanga, <verse eid="EPH 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 6:19" />mniyupili na nenga hilahila, lukani Sapanga anipeghi milando gha kulongela, niwesi kutangasa kifisu kya Habali Maha bila holu, <verse eid="EPH 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 6:20" />nenga ni mjumbi wa Habali Maha gha Yesu Kilisito, na hali lihengu ndiwa lyeni kunighola niwopwi. Hinu mniyupili ili nipati kuwela na makakala kutangasa vila ingupalwa.<verse eid="EPH 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo anguyomola lihamba lyaki kwa jambuso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 6:21" />Mlongo na mpalwa wa twenga Tikiko, mweni kughola mahengu gha Sapanga kwa umaheli, atewapegha habali zyangu zyogha mpati kumanya ghala ninguyaghola, <verse eid="EPH 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 6:22" />ningumyegha kwa mwenga, ili awalongeli habali zya twenga na mwenga mpati kutaywa moyu.<verse eid="EPH 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 6:23" />Ninguwayupila kwa Sapanga Tati wa twenga, na Yesu Kilisito awapeghi wakwinila wogha kulikala kwa kuponga na kupalana pamonga na kukwinila. <verse eid="EPH 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 6:24" />Ningumyupa Sapanga aweli mmaha nesu kwa mwenga kwa kila mmonga mweni kuyendelela kumpala yesu Kilisito.<verse eid="EPH 6:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 6" />
</usx>